note-mh-4\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-mh_4-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-mh_4-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFHoltjeLee1998\" class=\"citation book cs1\">Holtje, Steve; Lee, Nancy Ann (1998). <i>MusicHound: The Essential Album Guide</i>. Schirmer. p.&#160;1096.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=MusicHound%3A+The+Essential+Album+Guide&amp;rft.pages=1096&amp;rft.pub=Schirmer&amp;rft.date=1998&amp;rft.aulast=Holtje&amp;rft.aufirst=Steve&amp;rft.au=Lee%2C+Nancy+Ann&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AMr.+A.T.\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-penguin-5\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\">^ <a href=\"#cite_ref-penguin_5-0\"><sup><i><b>a</b></i></sup></a> <a href=\"#cite_ref-penguin_5-1\"><sup><i><b>b</b></i></sup></a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r1333433106\" /><cite id=\"CITEREFCookMorton1994\" class=\"citation book cs1\">Cook, Richard; Morton, Brian (1994). <i>The Penguin Guide to Jazz on CD, LP, and Cassette</i>. Penguin Books. p.&#160;1241.</cite><span title=\"ctx&#95;ver=Z39.88-2004&amp;rft&#95;val&#95;fmt=info%3Aofi%2Ffmt%3Akev%3Amtx%3Abook&amp;rft.genre=book&amp;rft.btitle=The+Penguin+Guide+to+Jazz+on+CD%2C+LP%2C+and+Cassette&amp;rft.pages=1241&amp;rft.pub=Penguin+Books&amp;rft.date=1994&amp;rft.aulast=Cook&amp;rft.aufirst=Richard&amp;rft.au=Morton%2C+Brian&amp;rfr&#95;id=info%3Asid%2Fen.wikipedia.org%3AMr.+A.T.\" class=\"Z3988\"></span></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-6\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><b><a href=\"#cite_ref-6\">^</a></b></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:T